B.agI=s(["Good, keep going like that.","Very good. I knew you could.","You\u2019re improving, I can see it."],t.s)
B.abH=s(["It\u2019s all right. We\u2019ll go again together.","Gently. Mistakes are part of the way.","Courage, you\u2019re almost there."],t.s)
